# Europium · Eu · gate 63

**Europium** (Eu) is element **63** of the periodic table — a **lanthanide**, period 6, group f-block, f-block, solid at standard conditions, atomic weight **151.96**.

## The element (carbon layer — reference chemistry)
The red and blue phosphor of the screen; the secret ink in a euro banknote.

## The gate (silicon layer — the 118 Gates)
